=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# ssh screen-nopam-locked --------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: SSH Login. web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23 (OpenSSH$
# 10.2p1, OpenRC, sshd without PAM). alpine323, but george's$
# account is "!" and george is the only admin: sshd without PAM$
# refuses george's key [I: not run], so he has no SSH login.$
# hardn runs as root on the console.$
$
# SSH Login ####################################################$
$
  [+] SSH Login            Configured root locked$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured key-only auth$
  [ ] SSH Port             Not Configured default (22)$
$
# SSH Configuration --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Root SSH Login       Locked root's account, no PAM$
   -  Password Login       Off by 50-cloud-init.conf$
   -  SSH Port             22$
   -  Allowed Users        Anyone$
  [?] Logged in as         Not known$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disallow root login  Root can't log in over SSH$
   2) Password login on    Let passwords log in again$
   3) Change SSH port      Now 22$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-3 or q]:$
$
$

